{
  "ledger": [
    "0:00-0:09 self-generated airflow from forward rolling: evidence is passing ground/background and motion blur; should mildly press loose shirt hem and pant cuffs backward; observed slight hem flare at speed (0:04) and neutral drape when crouched/slow (0:00, 0:07-0:08) — consistent with speed-dependent airflow",
    "0:01-0:04 gravity during ollie: evidence is skater and board airborne (0:02), then descent and landing (0:03-0:04); should accelerate body and board equally; observed board and body rise and fall together and land in contact — consistent",
    "ambient wind: no positive evidence (foliage and light poles static across all shots, no flags or loose debris); expected effect is none on clothing when subject is slow; observed shirt and pants hang naturally at 0:00 and 0:07-0:08 — no cause-less fabric streaming detected",
    "solar illumination/shadow: evidence is hard shadows on concrete (0:00 skater shadow lower-right; 0:05-0:09 shadow to skater's left); should stay directionally coherent within each shot; observed shadow direction stable per shot and consistent with lit side of subject — consistent; apparent direction change across shots attributable to camera repositioning",
    "camera motion confound: background smear at 0:04-0:05 is screen displacement from panning/fisheye, not foliage deformation; trees show no bending or flutter in any frame — ruled out as wind evidence"
  ],
  "findings": []
}
